{
  "request": "New patient registration and health questionnaire for our GP practice. Ask what the national GP registration form asks (previous GP, armed forces, arrival from abroad), then a health questionnaire: long-term conditions, current medicines, reactions to medicines, family history, smoking, alcohol, activity, carers, next of kin and how they want us to contact them. Include guidance on filling it in and consent for text and email messages.",
  "title": "New patient registration",
  "description": "Use when someone registers with the practice: their details, their previous practice, how to contact them, a health questionnaire, carers and next of kin, their choices about messages, and a declaration.",
  "maxPages": 5,
  "content": {
    "schemaVersion": 3,
    "branding": {
      "organizationName": "",
      "logoAsset": null,
      "logoDataUrl": null,
